===============================================================================
Discogs data (testdata/discogs/)
===============================================================================

The test fixtures are recorded responses from the Discogs API
(https://www.discogs.com/developers). Discogs publishes its release data under
CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The
fixtures contain image URLs but no images.

crate-labels uses the Discogs API but is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Discogs.

